{"id": "EUVD-2025-206445", "enisaUuid": "d3f329e2-783a-3c98-95d8-59b4e2a6947d", "description": "The net/url package does not set a limit on the number of query parameters in a query. While the maximum size of query parameters in URLs is generally limited by the maximum request header size, the net/http.Request.ParseForm method can parse large URL-encoded forms. Parsing a large form containing many unique query parameters can cause excessive memory consumption.", "datePublished": "2026-01-28T19:30:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-18T12:04:44", "baseScore": 7.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H", "references": ["https://go.dev/cl/736712", "https://go.dev/issue/77101", "https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/Vd2tYVM8eUc", "https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2026-4341"], "aliases": ["GHSA-gm9r-q53w-2gh4", "CVE-2025-61726"], "assigner": "Go", "epss": 2.33, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1db149d6-c9ab-35d0-b767-f339d613a57e", "product": {"name": "net/url", "vendor": {"name": "Go standard library"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.24.12"}, {"id": "f8780c6f-02da-36c0-9ce8-df60760c9d4a", "product": {"name": "net/url", "vendor": {"name": "Go standard library"}}, "product_version": "1.25.0 <1.25.6"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "38230220-2214-3f9a-862c-db3fdecfcea5", "vendor": {"name": "Go standard library"}}], "isExploited": false}